[36m(main_task pid=2827894)[0m Doc 1(Title: "Weimar Republic") Weimar Republic The Weimar Republic ( ) is an unofficial historical designation for the German state from 1918 to 1933. The name derives from the city of Weimar, where its constitutional assembly first took place. The official name of the state remained ""Deutsches Reich"" unchanged from 1871. Although commonly translated as ""German Empire"", the word ""Reich"" here better translates as ""realm"", in that the term does not in itself have monarchical connotations per se. In English, the country was usually known simply as Germany. Germany became a ""de facto"" republic on 9 November 1918 when Kaiser Wilhelm II abdicated the
