[36m(main_task pid=2827894)[0m Wikipedia "Germany" Germany (/ˈdʒɜːrməni/ ( listen); German: Deutschland, pronounced (ˈdɔʏtʃlant) ),[3] officially the Federal Republic of Germany (German: Bundesrepublik Deutschland, pronounced (ˈbʊndəsʁepuˌbli̯k ˈdɔʏtʃlant)), is a sovereign state in Central Europe. It is composed of sixteen federated states (known as Bundesländer in German, less known in English as federal states) and has an area of 357,022 square kilometres (137,847 sq mi) with 82.8 million inhabitants.
