[36m(main_task pid=2827894)[0m Germany is a presidential representative democracy with a parliamentary system. Germany's capital and largest metropolis is Berlin. Other major cities include Hamburg, Munich, Cologne, Frankfurt, Stuttgart and Düsseldorf. Germany comprises sixteen federated states, called Bundesländer in German, that retain limited sovereignty. Each Bundesland has its own state government, legislature, and judiciary. The capital city is Berlin.
